        oddE0 D D.host.ccK ch.S.Z.δ ch.S.Z.t0 _ _ e0 ∧ SD D Ls ∧ SD D Lt ∧ Mod1All κ ∧ 0 < k ∧
        (∀ i, k • s i ∈ La D (tor0 D D.host.ccK ch.S.Z.δ) Ls Lt) ∧ (∀ ρ₁ : Qbar →+* ℂ, ∑ i, ‖ρ₁ (r i)‖ ≤ 1) ∧
